## Troubleshooting & Common Gotchas

| Error / Symptom | Root Cause | Fix |
|---|---|---|
| `bind: address already in use :8080` | Another process is holding port `8080`. | Run `lsof -i :8080` and terminate the zombie process, or change `SERVICE_PORT=8081`. |
| `FATAL: role "postgres" does not exist` | Docker volume initialized with stale credentials. | Run `docker compose down -v` to reset local volumes. |
| `ECONNREFUSED 127.0.0.1:5432` | PostgreSQL is still warming up. | Wait 5 seconds for healthcheck or inspect `docker compose logs postgres`. |

